      "title": "Consensus EPS estimates fall by 15%, revenue upgraded",
      "body": "The consensus outlook for fiscal year 2027 has been updated. 2027 revenue forecast increased from ₹323.4b to ₹332.0b. EPS estimate fell from ₹93.74 to ₹79.93 per share. Net income forecast to grow 21% next year vs 21% growth forecast for Chemicals industry in India. Consensus price target down from ₹2,571 to ₹2,353. Share price fell 5.3% to ₹1,860 over the past week.",
