      "body": "Down from ₹2,571, the current price target is an average from 9 analysts. New target price is 26% above last closing price of ₹1,873. Stock is down 23% over the past year. The company is forecast to post earnings per share of ₹79.93 for next year compared to ₹66.41 last year.",
