      "title": "Coromandel International Limited Earnings Missed Analyst Estimates: Here's What Analysts Are Forecasting Now",
      "body": "Shareholders might have noticed that Coromandel International Limited ( NSE:COROMANDEL ) filed its full-year result...",
      "keyDevTypeId": null,
