      "title": "Dividend of ₹9.00 announced",
      "body": "Shareholders will receive a dividend of ₹9.00. Ex-date: 4th February 2026 Payment date: 28th February 2026 Dividend yield will be 0.8%, which is about the same as the industry average. Sustainability & Growth Dividend is well covered by both earnings (18% earnings payout ratio) and cash flows (31% cash payout ratio). The dividend has increased by an average of 14% per year over the past 10 years. However, payments have been volatile during that time. EPS is expected to grow by 35% over the next 2 years, which should provide support to the dividend and adequate earnings cover.",
